---

## The closed stacks

::bg{location="library" time="dusk"}
::music{action="start" mood="romantic" volume="down"}
::auto{character="soren" anchor="center" action="fadeInUp"}
@soren{emotion="shy"}: The closed stacks. Nobody comes here. That's the whole point of them. And of me, usually.
@soren: Every student since 1890 has hidden a letter in these books. I've read all of them. I'm not proud of it.

::date{with="soren" spot="library" resultKey="stacks"}

<match on="scene.date.stacks.mood">
  <when is="perfect">
    @soren{emotion="happy"}: You found the one I hid. I — I wrote it the night of the festival. Please read it when I'm not in the room. Please read it now.
    ::use{component="cg" id="cgSorenLetter"}
    ::set{run.aff.soren += 2}
  </when>
  <when is="sweet">
    @soren{emotion="fond"}: You read out loud like you're telling a secret. Do it again.
    ::set{run.aff.soren += 1}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @soren{emotion="sad"}: Sorry. I talked about bindings for forty minutes. Nobody wants to hear about bindings.
  </otherwise>
</match>
@narrator{when="scene.date.stacks.hearts >= 5"}: When the lamps click off, neither of you reaches for the switch.
